      "content": "u keep saying it's a risk but you're not really telling me if it's actually dangerous or just a bit more sleepy than usual. like, am i actually going to stop breathing or is it just gonna be a bit of a buzz? i really want to just relax and have this one drink. if i just stick to a tiny amount i'll be fine right?",
